    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 318 reported a significant gross prior year reserve release of GBP 91.981 million in 2021, representing a 47.22% reduction of its opening gross claims outstanding. This favorable development was primarily driven by healthy prior year releases and lower than average attritional loss activity, particularly for the Property account. While the 2020 year of account experienced higher than expected catastrophe losses from events like US Winter Storm Uri and Hurricane Ida in its Property account, the overall prior year development was positive. Reserves for COVID-19 remained stable.",
